{
    "name": "Backup APEX App to GitHub",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "An Oracle APEX Process Type plugin that exports an APEX application as a SQL file and uploads it to a GitHub repository via the GitHub REST API. Supports configurable branches, file paths, private repositories, chunked Base64 encoding for large applications, and detailed error reporting.",
